tinydtm incorporates a C99 adaptation of the scalar DTM2000 implementation
and its coefficient resource from Orekit, Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE).
Source: https://github.com/CS-SI/Orekit
Revision: 734c814858c114824f50292e838be057c614906f
Paths: src/main/java/org/orekit/models/earth/atmosphere/DTM2000.java
